msgctxt "quest/038/LucKsa050_03844:TEXT_LUCKSA050_03844_SYSTEM_800_000:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “Fire in the Forge,” you will receive a Resistance weapon for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "Обратите внимание: за выполнение задания «Куй оружие» вы получите оружие Сопротивления для профессии «<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のレジスタンス・ウェポンを作成しますか？
#. de: Möchtest du eine Waffe des Widerstands für deinen aktuellen Job <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> herstellen?
#. fr: Fabriquer l'arme de la résistance pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/038/LucKsa050_03844:TEXT_LUCKSA050_03844_Q1_800_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: もう少し考える
#. de: Nein, ich muss es mir noch mal überlegen.
#. fr: Prendre le temps de réfléchir
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/038/LucKsa050_03844:TEXT_LUCKSA050_03844_A1_800_000:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as another job."
msgstr "Выполнить задание за другую профессию."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のレジスタンス・ウェポンを作成する
#. de: Ja, ich will eine Waffe für den Job <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> herstellen.
#. fr: Fabriquer l'arme pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if>
#. speaker: A2
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
